					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-172360#post-2272439</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-172360/clef-and-dimitri-hit-the-road#post-2272439</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2015 17:43:43 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrClef</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>213153</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&#8230; yeah, this story is showing its age. The characterizations of everyone is out of whack (Clef having a sex drive? The GOC being mindless thugs? Texas being full of rednecks and assholes?). On the other hand, it was one of the first collab stories written between two authors, and it's a solid example of what the lolfoundation period was like, so I do have a soft spot for it.</p> <p>My headcanon is that the entire story is bullshit from the moment they leave Glass's office to the moment they come back, that the three of them really did just spend an entire month in Rio getting drunk, gambling, and such. Yoric's rope burns are from an overly enthusiastic amateur dominatrix. Clef got the lighter from some crazy asshole in a bar. Strelnikov was&#8230; Strelnikov.</p> <p>And the newspaper articles&#8230; ? Better not ask about those&#8230;</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
