				<wikidot:authorName>Ihp</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1267048</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>&#8230;this reads less like an SCP Foundation tale than it does a generic action film that just happens to be set in the SCP Foundation Universe. You could swap out Clef and Dmitri for any quirky buddy pair and it would make just as much sense. Also, I may hate the GOC, but they way they're portrayed in this tale is actually kind of mean-spirited and dumb; they knew that there would be consequences for kidnapping people as well-known in the Foundation as Clef and Strelnikov, so why did they do it? Oh, right; so Dmitri and Alto could be cool.</p> <p>Since this was recently reference in a Cool War tale, I gotta ask: Is This Cool Yet? No, it is not, and it never will be in my eyes. -1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
